<p style="position:absolute;top:197px;left:99px;white-space:nowrap" class="ft08">&#160;</p>
<p style="position:absolute;top:197px;left:108px;white-space:nowrap" class="ft07">Explain the principles of&#160;good argument and critical thinking.</p>
