<p style="position:absolute;top:643px;left:72px;white-space:nowrap" class="ft09">Simico, N.D&#160;and G.G&#160;James. (1983)&#160;Elementary&#160;Logic,&#160;Belmont, Ca:&#160;Wadsworth&#160;Publishing&#160;Company.</p>
